      "message": "I see the PPM callback is making this same change, so this doesn\u0027t belong here.\n\nSince all callbacks can be treated equally, it would make more sense to modify the existing API `pdc_set_handler_cb()` so that it manages a linked list of callbacks.\n\nZephyr\u0027s GPIO driver provides a model for this.\n[gpio_add_callback](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/third_party/zephyr/main/include/zephyr/drivers/gpio.h;l\u003d1717)\n[gpio_remove_callback](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/third_party/zephyr/main/include/zephyr/drivers/gpio.h;l\u003d1765)\n\nThe common utility [`gpio_manage_callback()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/third_party/zephyr/main/include/zephyr/drivers/gpio/gpio_utils.h;l\u003d54) manages the singly-linked list for each driver.",
